; Stationery · Calendar — its words in English. Original work, MIT licensed.
; Strings-Chinese.inc has the same keys. Menu titles are Title Case and at most 30 characters.

[Variables]
; the month's eyebrow: the Small shows the month alone, and the year only in another year ("JAN 2027"); the Medium
; always shows both. The meters set them in capitals
CalendarMonthFormat0=%B
CalendarMonthFormat1=%b %Y
CalendarMonthYearFormat=%B %Y
; the link back to this month, and its tooltip
CalendarToday=Today
CalendarGoToToday=Go to Today
; a week's number (%1): the Medium's subhead and each row's tooltip
CalendarWeekText=Week %1
; the card's sentence
CalendarSentence=Week [MeasureWeekNow], day [MeasureDayOfYear] of [MeasureYearDays]. [#Moon[&MeasureMoonEighth:0]].
; the right-click menu
CalendarMenuOpen=Open Calendar
CalendarMenuWeekNumbers0=Week Numbers: Off
CalendarMenuWeekNumbers1=Week Numbers: On
CalendarMenuMoon0=Moon Phase: Off
CalendarMenuMoon1=Moon Phase: On
